body:
Now the mod adds:
- monster with new loot;
- items for level up and recipes to them;
- RPG leveling;
- paranormal skills "teleport" and "pyromania";

Next updates will bring:
- new paranormal skills and system of getting it in survival;
- craft in two hands for multi result recipes;
- trader-helper with mod items;
- dynamic regeneration of chunks with random seeds;

Inspired by the book of A. Kamenistiy "Five lives of a cheater" and the game "Cataclysm DDA".

ATTENTION: The mod is in early alpha testing. Performance is not guaranteed. Use it only for reference purposes at the moment.
